{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"672375","name":"Bridget","description":"يقع هذا الفندق في الدائرة 20، على بُعد 3 كم من Grands Boulevards وParc des Buttes Chaumont وقناة Canal Saint-Martin. ويقع كل من متحف Picasso وParc de la Villette على بُعد 3 كم. تبعد محطة Gambetta مسافة 6 دقائق سيرًا على الأقدام، وتبعد محطة Pelleport مسافة 8 دقائق. إلى جانب خدمات الاستقبال، يوفر هذا الفندق الخالي من التدخين مكتب استقبال يعمل على مدار 24 ساعة وخدمة الواي فاي المجانية في المناطق العامة. توفر جميع الغرف البالغ عددها 31 خدمة إنترنت لاسلكي مجانية.","address":"Rue Des Pyrénées, 258","city":"PARIS","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"75020","lat":48.86906,"lng":2.39538,"stars":3,"giataCode":"1107223","phone":"+33177388181","email":"CONTACT@HOTELBRIDGET.COM","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_007.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_008.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_006.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_003.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_004.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_005.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024641","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_009.jpg?20250116185034?20250618024640","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_012.jpg?20250116185035?20250618024640","category":"exterior","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/67/672375/672375a_hb_a_01